      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>BUILD GUIDE</b>


    1. Slide the three tail fins into the slots at
    the base.

    2. Fit the three wing flaps at the midpoint, swept edge up.

    3.
    Press the nose cone onto the top.

    4. Insert the motor, nozzle down.

    5.
    Twist the motor cap until it clicks.


    Submit at the bin, then launch.'
